                <note rend="inline" type="source">817.51/1727: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        the Minister in Nicaragua</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Eberhardt</hi>)</head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Paraphrase]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1927-02-11T18:00:00-05:00"><hi rendition="#italic">February 11,
                                1927—6 p.m.</hi></date></dateline></opener>
                <p>39. In reply to Legation’s telegram number 38, February 9, 9 p.m., the Department
                    is not disposed to offer any objection to this loan.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Kellogg</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
